"""PARKED, NOT SHIPPED -- Lot: tyres wear the paint where they cross it.

site_streets.wheel_offsets / wheel_gaps: two wheel paths a driving lane; a seeded share of crosswalk and stop bars worn
through where they cross (`gaps` on the marking); lot._marking_quads lays a quad a painted piece. Unversioned: the
VERSION and CHANGELOG go in when it ships.

WHY PARKED: the vertical slice has no crossing, so no crosswalk or stop bar -- slice 25 built it and its markings
carry no bar (draws +0). Never seen in a frame; ship it with the first level that has a junction, after its frames.

Proven: tests/test_wheel_wear.py fails on 0.138.0 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone suite fails the same 12 tests as an
untouched 0.138.0 in the same place (suite_clone.out.txt).
"""
